"also clearly and legibly identify you as the publisher of these copies. The "
"front cover must present the full title with all words of the title equally "
"prominent and visible. You may add other material on the covers in addition."
" Copying with changes limited to the covers, as long as they preserve the "
"title of the Document and satisfy these conditions, can be treated as "
"verbatim copying in other respects."
msgstr ""
"若您出版超過 100 份的文件印刷複本（或複製於通常有印刷封面的媒介），且文件的授"
"權聲明要求封面文字，您必須將複本置於清楚、易讀地承載所有封面文字的封套中：前"
"封面文字置於前封面，後封面文字置於後封面。兩個封面都必須清楚且易讀地標明您是"
"這些複本的出版者。前封面必須呈現完整標題，標題的所有字詞同樣醒目可見。您可以"
"在封面上額外新增其他材料。只要修改僅限於封面，並保留文件標題且符合這些條件，"
"其餘方面可視為逐字複製。"

#. (itstool) path: appendix/simpara
#: C/appendix-gnu-fdl-1.3.xml:174
msgid ""
"If the required texts for either cover are too voluminous to fit legibly, "
"you should put the first ones listed (as many as fit reasonably) on the "
"actual cover, and continue the rest onto adjacent pages."
msgstr ""
"若任一封面所需的文字過於繁多而無法清楚容納，您應將最先列出的文字（盡量合理地"
"多放一些）置於實際封面上，其餘的繼續置於相鄰頁面。"

#. (itstool) path: appendix/simpara
#: C/appendix-gnu-fdl-1.3.xml:179
msgid ""
