#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:105
msgid ""
"A <productname>Caja</productname> plugin which exports in real time to D-Bus"
" the currently selected files."
msgstr ""
"一個 <productname>Caja</productname> 外掛程式，可即時將目前選取的檔案匯出到 "
"D-Bus。"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:111
msgid "A command-line program which is able to run any action."
msgstr "一個可以執行任何動作的命令列程式。"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:114
msgid ""
"Associated with the D-Bus interface, this program lets the user run any "
"action from a keyboard shortcut, applying this action to the item(s) "
"currently selected in the file manager."
msgstr ""
"與 D-Bus 介面關聯，此程式讓使用者可以從鍵盤捷徑執行任何動作，並將此動作套用於"
"檔案管理員中目前選取的項目。"

#. (itstool) path: listitem/para
#: C/index.docbook:121
msgid "A command-line program which is able to create a new action."
msgstr "一個可以建立新動作的命令列程式。"

